    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/44a4f4a0c134b2fd40a333b54aaf3ec6.webp?t=1741251815\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/9f76da27cd941d2f8f305cbca1499977.poster.avif?t=1741251815\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/9f76da27cd941d2f8f305cbca1499977.webm?t=1741251815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/9f76da27cd941d2f8f305cbca1499977.mp4?t=1741251815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Make sweet ice cream, popsicles, and waffles using your creativity in one of the best dessert decorating games!</strong><br><br>Experience the satisfaction of preparing your customers' orders with your own hands, meeting their expectations, and witnessing their delightful reactions! Explore a variety of delicious molds, creams, syrups, and sweet ingredients to create mouthwatering works of art!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/6be7b7e591cde6b03a5769a7b611279b.webp?t=1741251815\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/10f28ae24b13817d4a733bdf17e1f6b5.poster.avif?t=1741251815\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/10f28ae24b13817d4a733bdf17e1f6b5.webm?t=1741251815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/10f28ae24b13817d4a733bdf17e1f6b5.mp4?t=1741251815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Does your customer want to take revenge on someone? Prepare yucky desserts with surprise bugs or chili peppers! Such a taste is definitely something no one will ever forget! <br><br>Every dessert sold brings you coins, a delightful reward that you can invest in enhancing the appearance of your store. Change the colors of your walls or floor, and add new furniture. Transform your store into a cozy and professional haven, all while having fun! <br><br>Ready to get your hands dirty and make unique, colorful desserts?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pick up a dessert of your choice<br></li><li>Experiment with flavor<br></li><li>Enjoy all kinds of decoration tools<br></li><li>Make a combo with ingredients, syrup, frosting, etc.<br></li><li>Get creative with decorative toppings<br></li><li>Upgrade your sweet shop by selling delicious desserts to customers</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/44a4f4a0c134b2fd40a333b54aaf3ec6.webp?t=1741251815\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/9f76da27cd941d2f8f305cbca1499977.poster.avif?t=1741251815\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/9f76da27cd941d2f8f305cbca1499977.webm?t=1741251815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/9f76da27cd941d2f8f305cbca1499977.mp4?t=1741251815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Make sweet ice cream, popsicles, and waffles using your creativity in one of the best dessert decorating games!</strong><br><br>Experience the satisfaction of preparing your customers' orders with your own hands, meeting their expectations, and witnessing their delightful reactions! Explore a variety of delicious molds, creams, syrups, and sweet ingredients to create mouthwatering works of art!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/6be7b7e591cde6b03a5769a7b611279b.webp?t=1741251815\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/10f28ae24b13817d4a733bdf17e1f6b5.poster.avif?t=1741251815\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/10f28ae24b13817d4a733bdf17e1f6b5.webm?t=1741251815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2395850/extras/10f28ae24b13817d4a733bdf17e1f6b5.mp4?t=1741251815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Does your customer want to take revenge on someone? Prepare yucky desserts with surprise bugs or chili peppers! Such a taste is definitely something no one will ever forget! <br><br>Every dessert sold brings you coins, a delightful reward that you can invest in enhancing the appearance of your store. Change the colors of your walls or floor, and add new furniture. Transform your store into a cozy and professional haven, all while having fun! <br><br>Ready to get your hands dirty and make unique, colorful desserts?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pick up a dessert of your choice<br></li><li>Experiment with flavor<br></li><li>Enjoy all kinds of decoration tools<br></li><li>Make a combo with ingredients, syrup, frosting, etc.<br></li><li>Get creative with decorative toppings<br></li><li>Upgrade your sweet shop by selling delicious desserts to customers</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Preparing delicious desserts is a piece of cake. Try it yourself!",
